      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need help putting together a 5 day itinerary for an exec traveling to southeast asia next month. they need to hit singapore, bangkok, and ho chi minh city for meetings. can u help me map out a schedule that's efficient with travel times and includes some decent business hotels and spots for formal dinners? thanks",
