      "content": "thanks. one thing—the exec is kind of worried about stuff getting delayed or things going wrong with the flights/transfers while they're in these cities. can u give me a more detailed day-by-day breakdown of the travel logistics? specifically how they get from the airport to the hotels and what we should do if there's an unexpected delay in one of the cities.",
